<title>USA: Company Doctor says hires Southcoast.</title>
<headline>Company Doctor says hires Southcoast.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Doctor said Monday it has hired Southcoast Capital Corp as an adviser on acquisitions and strategic combinations with financial, insurance and health care delivery entities.</p>
<p>The company said it hired Southcoast to advise it on ways to maximize shareholder value.</p>
<p>The company reported a loss per share of $0.07 for the third quarter ended March 31, compared to a profit of $0.01 per share for the same period a year ago.</p>
